{
  "case_id": "SHOP-N2-1.21.1",
  "title": "卡牌商店·任务N′：悬停/选中贴图、沙漏 4 份、不可用态图标、拖拽三连+反例、转账面板 2× 越界、创造栏置顶与 TTT/BBB/MMM 配方",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "card-shop"
  },
  "on_fail": "continue",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "任务N′ 1.21.1 实机验收（哨兵 787）：① 主视图两按钮新位置（星光兑换在左 11,109 / 转账在右 48,109）；② 转账面板整体 2× 全貌 + 越界自检；③ 返回键无多余 <；④ 悬停=shop_card_cursor、点击选中=shop_card_select；⑤ 沙漏 4→1→0（含就绪保持）；⑥ 不可用态转账/星光图标（含按下 _push）；⑦ 拖拽三连（单击选中 / 原版 16x16 小图标跟随 / 落包后货架 soldout + 物品栏出现该卡）+ 反例（落点不在格内 ⇒ 不发包、无扣款）；⑧⑨ 由探针 csTail 在商店屏之外取证（创造栏排序 + JEI 配方 TTT/BBB/MMM）。④⑥ 由外部 temp/t91/real_cursor.ps1 送**真实 OS 光标/左键**驱动（探针落 evt=n2_need_* 信标后轮询 hoverState 确认命中）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "转账面板截图②需要有候选行 ⇒ 用 Carpet 招 4 个假玩家（真 ServerPlayer）当候选；本场景不需要滚动条。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/carpet allowSpawningOfflinePlayers true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player Bot1 spawn",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 250
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player Bot2 spawn",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 250
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player Bot3 spawn",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 250
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player Bot4 spawn",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 250
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "开屏前先把余额/星光/冷却设好（界面开着时注入的聊天命令会被 GUI 吞掉；787 场景内部改用 connection.sendCommand 再改档）。余额=787 既是探针武装带的哨兵，也是本场景的 gate。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop reset N2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop star N2 20",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop bal N2 787",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "开屏并保持：客户端探针按 787 阶段机跑完全部时序（星光不可用/可用 → 卡牌悬停与真实点击 → 拖拽反例与正例 → 沙漏 4/1/0 → 转账灰化 → 面板 2× 与越界 → 搜索框焦点 → 返回 → 复原并关屏），随后 csTail 在屏外取证创造栏与 JEI 配方。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop openkeep N2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1100
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 150000
    },
